00:06:43.982 --> 00:06:49.862
often as the strongest baseline when the script matched pre-training scripts. A pre-answer edit

00:06:49.862 --> 00:06:56.222
in a QN-34 billion case changes the emitted number from 17 to 15, while both runs first

00:06:56.222 --> 00:07:02.402
emit 1, and later multi-layer perceptron, or MLP, clamping reduces the final log odds

00:07:02.402 --> 00:07:11.502
gap to 0.0025 net. Confucius 4R2T2 is obtained by post-training QN-3 automatic speech recognition,

00:07:11.502 --> 00:07:19.522
or ASR, 1.7 billion on 1,500 hours of audio, while freezing the encoder, and it delivers

00:07:19.522 --> 00:07:24.202
stable text with low emission lag and generalizes beyond the adaptation languages.

00:07:24.922 --> 00:07:31.222
Continued pre-training on 375 million Tajik tokens, followed by supervised fine-tuning

00:07:31.222 --> 00:07:38.522
raised Belebelay accuracy 11.4 points above Quinn 38 billion, while English MMLU changed

00:07:38.522 --> 00:07:44.282
