00:07:44.282 --> 00:07:52.662
realization by 0.204 to 0.244 points on a 0-2 scale, yet increased fabricated evidence

00:07:52.662 --> 00:08:02.942
failures from 5.8% to 10.1% to 10.4%. The best NTCIR-19 cyclame EVAL systems reached 98.1%

