11.5 percentage points within one model, while the same model compliance reviewer cut banking

00:08:21.042 --> 00:08:29.842
conduct rule violations from 9.6% to 6.4%. Combined sparse attention on six hybrid models from 4 billion

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:37.882
to 397 billion parameters, yields up to 2.23 times faster decoding at 256,000 context,

00:08:38.322 --> 00:08:42.102
