Asamese LM-E2B, a 2 billion model with expanded byte-level byte-paring coding,

00:08:48.602 --> 00:08:58.142
or BPE vocabulary, reaches 0.7488 bits per byte on floors 296.7% retrieval augmented generation,

00:08:58.142 --> 00:09:03.822
